KG42.register("clusters-6478d28f0763afa4b106b284",{"id":"45-heat_pump_flexibility::v142-d-CL005","paper":"45-heat_pump_flexibility","label":"Post-delivery metered settlement, imbalance charges, and conditional daily-peak charges","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL005","label":"Post-delivery metered settlement, imbalance charges, and conditional daily-peak charges","market_meaning":"After electricity delivery, settlement is based on metered data; accepted transactions use the uniform price of the corresponding clearing round and bear applicable fees and taxes as well as imbalance charges arising from deviation from the traded position. The daily-peak charge serves only as a conditional branch of the proposed measure; the MPC objective in R013 is not treated as a closed actual settlement bill.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["settlement","activation","participation","clearing"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"Delivery, participants' own-balance responsibility, and the clearing price are referenced as settlement interfaces. Basic settlement and the optional daily-peak charge apply separately; planned power, metered actual values, and traded positions are not automatically equated, nor are clearing prices merged across rounds.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"Metering, clearing price, responsible entity, and deviation conditions jointly define the settlement obligation. R013 already frozenly contains a daily-peak-charge MPC objective, so its independent conditional branch is retained and the gap is disclosed; optimization, peak charging, and the actual bill are not treated as the same expression.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R013","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Carries post-delivery metered settlement, cost composition, imbalance charges, and the daily-peak-charge proposal."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Only references the post-clearing delivery and physical transaction nodes, providing the delivery-to-settlement interface."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R010","ownership":"shared","role":"support","rationale":"Provides the scope of participants that bear own-balance responsibility in settlement, without duplicating ownership of participation rules."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Provides the uniform price threshold and the scope of accepted transactions for the same auction instance; the clearing algorithm is not re-assembled here."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL005-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R013","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R013::E::v141-c-R013-E001","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C002","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e06"],"rationale":"The source places delivery and subsequent metered settlement in the same process; this assembly retains the timing and the metering purpose, and no new performance guarantee is derived from the sequence."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL005-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R013","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C004","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C005"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g03-E10"],"rationale":"Own-balance responsibility and the imbalance charge when actual behavior deviates from accepted transactions have an explicit responsibility-and-consequence link; no deviation-amount formula is supplied from this."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL005-L003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R013","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-p-market","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C006","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C007"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R013::theta::c_lem_t","v141-c-R013::E::v141-c-R013-E002","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e12","v141-b-g02-e12","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g03-E02"],"rationale":"The uniform market price of the same auction instance serves as a price input in settlement and in the cost objective; the clearing round and delivery index are not yet aligned, so only a quantity interface is asserted, and no cross-round price-equality mapping is established."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL005-O001","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R013::V::execution.energy_trade"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R007::V::execution.energy_trade","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e06"],"rationale":"All refer to the physical energy transaction at delivery; the MPC planned-power object is not interpreted as already realized physical metering."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL005-O002","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R013::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R003::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e12","v141-b-g02-e16"],"rationale":"All reference the local clearing-pricing function; the distinct local roles of clearing threshold, cost input, and actual settlement are not merged."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL005-G001","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R013-C006 is a modified MPC objective rather than a complete actual bill. Under C's current power and price units, the energy term has no explicit time step; the summed outer peak term still carries a time index, and the correspondence between the next-24 h maximum and the actual daily charge is not clear. Planned power also cannot automatically replace metered actual values.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R013"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C003","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C006","v141-c-R013::x::P_grid_import_t","v141-c-R013::x::P_grid_export_t","v141-c-R013::x::P_peak_t","v141-c-R013::theta::c_peak"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g02-e12"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Verify the time integral in the original formula, the peak index, and the boundaries between the rolling horizon and the charging day, and distinguish planned optimization from actual settlement; D does not insert time factors, billing formulas, or charge values."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL005-G002","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The existing chain states that deviation generates a charge, but there is no object for the difference between metered actual quantity and accepted traded position, no direction rule, and no charge-calculation constraint. Although Table 3 provides related prices, this still does not allow the missing amount formula to be regarded as established.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R007","v141-c-R010","v141-c-R013"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C004","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C005"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g03-E10"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Upstream explicitly extracts the traded position, actual metering, deviation direction, and conditions for applying the charge; do not treat the exemption-threshold suggestion under discussion as an implemented rule."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL005-G003","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The clearing-price input in R013 is indexed by t, whereas the same delivery period may correspond to multiple trading rounds and prices; the existing objects do not provide the complete correspondence among price, accepted quantity, round, and final bill.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R013"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-p-market","v141-c-R007::theta::p_market","v141-c-R013::theta::c_lem_t","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e12","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g03-E02"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Verify the correspondence among clearing round, delivery period, transaction volume, and price unit; a single delivery-time price must not replace the prices of all transaction rounds."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL005-G004","category":"ontology_extension","description":"Imbalance charges and daily-peak charges are based respectively on deviation and on peak values, and are not simply clearing-transaction payments or local electricity prices. The corresponding node proposals remain pending, and R013 currently retains these functions in the existing payment node.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R013"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R013::V::settlement.payment","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C005","v141-c-R013::phi::v141-c-R013-C006","v141-c-R013::theta::c_peak"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e12","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g03-E10","v141-b-g04-e01","v141-b-g04-e06"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g02-prop-demand-charge","v141-b-g03-P01","proposal:daily_demand_charge","v141-b-g03-P02","proposal:imbalance_settlement"],"required_work":"Manually handle these unapproved proposals and their potential overlap, and then have upstream explicitly revise the functional representation; D does not insert nodes or merge different charges into the clearing price."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL005-G005","category":"unverified_source","description":"Metered settlement, charge composition, and daily-peak-charge expressions are still based on unreviewed materials permitted for the experiment.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R010","v141-c-R013"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e12","v141-b-g02-e12","v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g03-E02","v141-b-g03-E10","v141-b-g04-e01"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the transcription, units, cost scope, and each interface; do not claim that the source or downstream scientific content has passed independent review."}]},"rule_refs":["45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R013","45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R007","45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R010","45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R003"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-8172b6641813aad0","COMP-89ca1857e29bb0c7","COMP-aa5d858a916162e7","COMP-dddeb5d9e9238551","KG40-12aedc3eec573697","KG40-20f45ec4bdcbac06","KG40-72006c4bf7355110","KG40-a82c49d45641943a"]});
